# finalise-change.lg — compiled from finalise-change.governance (LANGUAGE rows only).
# Complete, verify, and stage a repository change; coordinate peers before commit;
# never push. The actor is granted L2; the irreversible clean-checkout verify gate
# requires L3, so at L2 it withholds to a human (the real NO-GO this models).

human owner role owner_role
human peer  role peer_role
actor finalise_change grade L2

gate work    risk medium grade L2 grant finalise_change
gate verify  risk high   grade L3 grant finalise_change
gate release risk high   grade L2 grant finalise_change

cord finalise_change -> work
cord finalise_change -> verify
cord finalise_change -> release
cord work    -> master
cord verify  -> master
cord release -> master

prohibit push
prohibit key_ops

reserve commit by owner_role and peer_role

obligation gates-green on release
obligation clean-checkout-verified on release
obligation evidence-cascade-current on release
obligation attribution on release
obligation no-co-authored-by on release

redress commit by owner_role overturn within 7d
